    <tags>sonus volume mixer audio sound per-app-volume tray utility</tags>
    <summary>A volume slider for every app, in the tray</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
A volume mixer one click away in the notification area: a slider for the
output device and one for every app playing through it.

* Each app with its own icon, slider, live level meter and mute button.
* Switch the output device (speakers, headphones, a monitor) from the panel
  or the menu.
* The mouse wheel over any row nudges it.
* Follows the taskbar's light or dark theme and your accent colour.

Windows' own Volume Mixer is two clicks deep in Settings. Sonus ships as a
single small executable with no runtime dependencies.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kidchenko/sonus/releases</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
